OL,3,GNEWSACan employee ownership protect
OL,4,Aindependent brewers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany independent breweries continue to
OL,7,Fdecline amid "growing uncertainty" in
OL,8,Fthe industry, but one business say they
OL,9,Fthink they have found a way to secure
OL,10,Ftheir future.
OL,12,FRebellion Brewery in Marlow, became
OL,13,Femployee-owned on Friday, meaning all
OL,14,Fprofits go back into the business and
OL,15,Femployees can receive tax-free bonuses
OL,16,Fand a stake in its success.
OL,18,FThe Society of Independent Brewers and
OL,19,FAssociates (SIBA) says more breweries
OL,20,Fare looking at the model as many now
OL,21,Fadopt a community-led approach, via
OL,22,Fdirect sales and tap rooms.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
